  "bio": "Chris Hollifield is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the black and gray style who has been honing his craft since 1993. As the owner of Dragons Den Tattoo Company in Granite Falls, NC, he upholds the highest standards of cleanliness, ensuring each client’s experience is not only artistically superb but also meticulously hygienic. His reputation for maintaining a sterile work environment is as prominent as his artistry, making him a trusted name in the tattooing community.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nOwner of Dragons Den Tattoo Company  Granite Falls N.C.Tattooing since 1993. Host of the carolina tattoo gathering",
